From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:13:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=module_identifier, 
 VK_EXT_shader_module_identifier

With MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=module_identifier, KosmicKrisp advertises
VK_EXT_shader_module_identifier and its shaderModuleIdentifier feature,
as vkd3d-proton's pipeline cache and DXVK's pipeline libraries use them.
Without the flag nothing changes.

Everything else is the common runtime's, as on Honeykrisp: the
identifier is the SPIR-V's BLAKE3 (vk_common_GetShaderModuleIdentifierEXT
and vk_common_GetShaderModuleCreateInfoIdentifierEXT), the algorithm UUID
the "MESA-BLAKE3" KosmicKrisp already reports, and vk_pipeline.c hashes
an identifier in place of the module. A pipeline created from an
identifier, which must carry
VK_PIPELINE_CREATE_FAIL_ON_PIPELINE_COMPILE_REQUIRED_BIT, is made only
when its compiled shaders are in the pipeline cache, the device's cache
or Mesa's disk cache; otherwise it returns VK_PIPELINE_COMPILE_REQUIRED
and compiles nothing, and the caller compiles from SPIR-V. No shader or
cache key changes.

Linear: PLA-431
Class: feature
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-22-kk-module-identifier-host.md
Offered-upstream: not yet
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c           | 1 +
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h           | 5 +++++
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c | 5 +++++
 3 files changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
index 6671be9..07d7f11 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
@@ -61,6 +61,7 @@ const struct debug_named_value experimental_flags[] = {
    {"ds_dont_care", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_DS_DONT_CARE},
    {"ubo_vec4_bounds", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_UBO_VEC4_BOUNDS},
    {"memory_priority", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MEMORY_PRIORITY},
+   {"module_identifier", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MODULE_IDENTIFIER},
    {NULL, 0},
 };
 
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
index e61b2e7..54f5e9b 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
@@ -242,6 +242,11 @@ enum kk_experimental {
     * VK_EXT_pageable_device_local_memory. Their priorities are accepted and
     * change nothing: every heap stays in the device's one residency set */
    KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MEMORY_PRIORITY = 1ull << 16,
+   /* Playport (PLA-431): advertise VK_EXT_shader_module_identifier. The
+    * common runtime's identifier is the SPIR-V's BLAKE3; a pipeline made from
+    * one finds its shaders in a pipeline cache or the disk cache, or fails
+    * with VK_PIPELINE_COMPILE_REQUIRED */
+   KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MODULE_IDENTIFIER = 1ull << 17,
 };
 
 extern enum kk_experimental kk_mesa_experimental_flags;
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
index 5b0ab8e..5e0b9cb 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
@@ -235,6 +235,8 @@ kk_get_device_extensions(const struct kk_instance *instance,
       .EXT_robustness2 = true,
       .EXT_sample_locations = true,
       .EXT_shader_atomic_float = true,
+      /* Playport: only with MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=module_identifier (PLA-431) */
+      .EXT_shader_module_identifier = KK_EXPERIMENTAL(MODULE_IDENTIFIER),
       .EXT_shader_replicated_composites = true,
       .EXT_shader_subgroup_ballot = true,
       .EXT_shader_subgroup_vote = true,
@@ -551,6 +553,9 @@ kk_get_device_features(
       /* VK_EXT_provoking_vertex */
       .provokingVertexLast = true,
 
+      /* VK_EXT_shader_module_identifier, Playport (PLA-431) */
+      .shaderModuleIdentifier = KK_EXPERIMENTAL(MODULE_IDENTIFIER),
+
       /* VK_EXT_shader_replicated_composites */
       .shaderReplicatedComposites = true,
 
